<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss bonds end firm, Conf cruises to new high.</title>
<headline>Swiss bonds end firm, Conf cruises to new high.</headline>
<text>
<p>1635 GMT - Swiss bonds end firm with Confederate Bond futures contract near Tuesday's fresh intraday highs. Swiss franc strength versus mark helped demand.</p>
<p>* March Conf ends 48 basis points higher at 122.37.</p>
<p>* 4-1/2 pct cash govt June 2007 ylds 3.35 vs 3.398 pct.</p>
</text>
